# Codex Governance

Read `AGENTS.md` and `PROJECT.md` before substantial work.
If `rules/` exists, follow the matching rule files for git, security, testing, and stack-specific behavior.
Treat `skills/` as task-triggered reference cards, not always-on prose.
For semantic edits to `AGENTS.md`, `rules/*`, or `skills/*`, keep verification evidence traceable in repository files.
